  "description": "Hello and welcome to my store!\nThis set is a part of Lovely Lines Spring edition collection. Delicate grey line works in spring theme are complemented with organic abstract shapes of pastel spring colours. This collection is great for making spring cards, logos, business branding or a trendy wall art for your interior.\nI’ve also included 10 pre-made compositions, which you can use for your business or personal designs.\nThe collection also includes 12 seamless patterns + 6 unique PNG pattern repeats for you to create your own designs by dropping a background of your choice.\nProduct details:\n•\t21 PNG line art elements in GREY\n•\t21 PNG line art elements in WHITE\n•\t21 SVG line art elements\n•\t46 PNG shape files\n•\t46 SVG shape files\n•\t2 AI files with Line Elements and Shapes\n•\t2 EPS files with Line Elements and Shapes\n•\t10 pre-made compositions – individual PNG files\n•\t12 JPEG pattern files\n•\t6 PNG pattern repeats files\n•\tall files are high resolution (300 dpi)\n•\tDownload files will be watermarks free\nAll images are coloured and ready to use. Colours on your screen may be slightly different from the actual print.\nIf you would like to change image size of this design, have any questions or special requests, please contact me.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Hello and welcome to my store!</p>\n<p>This set is a part of Lovely Lines Spring edition collection. Delicate grey line works in spring theme are complemented with organic abstract shapes of pastel spring colours. This collection is great for making spring cards, logos, business branding or a trendy wall art for your interior.<br>\nI’ve also included 10 pre-made compositions, which you can use for your business or personal designs.</p>\n<p>The collection also includes 12 seamless patterns + 6 unique PNG pattern repeats for you to create your own designs by dropping a background of your choice.</p>\n<p>Product details:</p>\n<p>•\t21 PNG line art elements in GREY<br>\n•\t21 PNG line art elements in WHITE<br>\n•\t21 SVG line art elements<br>\n•\t46 PNG shape files<br>\n•\t46 SVG shape files<br>\n•\t2 AI files with Line Elements and Shapes<br>\n•\t2 EPS files with Line Elements and Shapes<br>\n•\t10 pre-made compositions – individual PNG files<br>\n•\t12 JPEG pattern files<br>\n•\t6 PNG pattern repeats files<br>\n•\tall files are high resolution (300 dpi)<br>\n•\tDownload files will be watermarks free</p>\n<p>All images are coloured and ready to use. Colours on your screen may be slightly different from the actual print.<br>\nIf you would like to change image size of this design, have any questions or special requests, please contact me.</p>",
